                            <comment id="16296542" author="somefire" created="Tue, 19 Dec 2017 09:35:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=zstan&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;zstan&quot;&gt;zstan&lt;/a&gt;, I&apos;ve done with your comment, can you review again?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16306231" author="zstan" created="Fri, 29 Dec 2017 12:12:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=dvryaboy&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;dvryaboy&quot;&gt;dvryaboy&lt;/a&gt; thanks, but i mean that you just need to register clear task, like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
